Description:
 edulution-linbo-vdi - linbo vdi server tool for linuxmuster.net v7.x
Changes:
 edulution-linbo-vdi (1.0.1-1) noble; urgency=medium
 .
   * Rewrite as proper Python package (edulution_linbo_vdi)
   * Add interactive setup wizard (vdi-setup)
   * Move REST API to linuxmuster-api (endpoints under /v1/vdi/)
   * Support EFI/BIOS boot and Windows 10/11, Ubuntu, Debian images
   * Use linked clones, add VirtIO RNG for PXE boot under EFI
   * Improve master rebuild detection and reduce log noise
